# Generated evidence and reports. Each phase's outputs/ folder is kept in the
# repo (via .gitkeep) but its contents are not committed by default - pcaps get
# large, and a capture of your own network traffic is not something to push to
# a shared remote without thinking about it first.
#
# When you DO want to share a specific result with the team (hosts.json and
# protocol_stats.json are the two Phase 4 needs), force-add it:
#     git add -f phase1_discovery/outputs/hosts.json
*/outputs/*
!*/outputs/.gitkeep
!*/outputs/*.json
!*/outputs/*.csv

# Captures are big and can contain personal browsing traffic - never commit.
*.pcap
*.pcapng

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.idea/
.vscode/
~$*.xlsx
